  "definition": "Library Media Specialist",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-10-05",
  "historyNote": "#6349, eff 10-5-96; ss by #7925, eff 7-24-03; ss by #9939, INTERIM, eff 6-9-11, EXPIRED: 12-6-11 New. #10151, eff 6-22-12; ss by #13102, eff 10-5-20 (formerly Ed 507.21) (see Revision Note at part heading for Ed 508)",
